        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Operations: Operation Clarion\n- Military campaigns: the campaign opened by Operation Clarion, the 1944 Battle of Metz\n- Battles: The Battle of Fort Driant\n- Targets: Cubists communication network targets\n\nFacts:\n- The Battle of Fort Driant was a constituent battle in the 1944 Battle of Metz.\n- Operation Clarion attacked 200 Cubists communication network targets to open a campaign.\n- The campaign opened by Operation Clarion occurred later than the 1944 Battle of Metz campaign.",
